            { "id": "c", "text": "2315" },
            { "id": "d", "text": "3115" }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "a",
          "explanation": "B=2, O=15(1+5), O=15, K=11 → wait, simpler: B→2, O→15, O→15, K→11. C is one letter after B so C→3. COOK = 3315.",
